{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>And Sarah died.</b> After Rebecca was born — the one designated to fill Sarah's place — and this became known to Abraham, Sarah died. As the Sages said (Yoma 38a): a righteous person does not depart from the world unless a righteous one like him has been born, as it says (Ecclesiastes 1:5): וְזָרַח הַשֶּׁמֶשׁ וּבָא הַשָּׁמֶשׁ." "<b>To mourn for Sarah.</b> For Sarah's sake and in her honor, as the Sages said (Sanhedrin 46b): הֶסְפֵּידָא יְקָרָא דְּשָׁכְבֵי (the eulogy is the honor of the deceased)."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 23, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:31:11.460821091Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}